            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/boundaries"} boundaries
            of all the disks, i.e. forming the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quotient+topological+space"} quotient topological space
            by the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unit+sphere+bundle"} unit sphere bundle
            = succeed ":" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
